  ✅ Supported choice react-vite-supabase is recorded verbatim as USER_CONFIRMED
  ✅ Supported choice flutter-supabase is recorded verbatim as USER_CONFIRMED
  ✅ Manual entry is trimmed, kept verbatim (no alias rewrite, no substitution)
