  ✅ Goal text and existing stack mentioning React/Flutter do NOT select a technology
  ✅ Hostile manual text is data: no DOM injection, newlines flattened, stored verbatim
  ✅ Over-long manual technology (>5000) is rejected with a visible error, not truncated
  ✅ UI-built Blueprint has flat list fields (no nested [[]]) so the consumer subset stays valid (regression: users/roles/target_platforms)
  ✅ Save → reload → reopen restores supported and manual choices; version compare reports the change

